Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:01:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《加勒比海盗2: 亡灵宝藏》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:28.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是怎么回事? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is this happening? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼前让新郎见到新娘是厄运之兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad luck for the groom to see the bride before the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:40.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪开 让我过去 大胆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way! Let me through! How dare you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:43.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上让你的人滚蛋 听见没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand your men down at once. Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:48.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,韦瑟比·斯旺总督 久违啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Governor Weatherby Swann, it's been too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:51.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 卡特勒·贝克特? - 现在是贝克特勋爵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cutler Beckett? - It's Lord now, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你是不是勋爵 你没有理由 也没有权利逮捕这位先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord or not, you have no reason and no authority to arrest this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:01.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我有 玛萨先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I do. Mr Mercer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有授权 逮捕人犯威廉·特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warrant for the arrest of one William Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:17.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个逮捕证是伊丽莎白·斯旺的 - 是吗? 真麻烦 是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This warrant is for Elizabeth Swann. - Is it? That's annoying. My mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把她抓起来 - 罪名是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Arrest her. - On what charges?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:23.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是威廉·特纳的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aha. Here's the one for William Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:27.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有另外一张 是詹姆斯·诺灵顿先生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have another one for a Mr James Norrington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:30.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在这吗? - 罪名是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he present? - What are the charges?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿司令官数月前辞职了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore Norrington resigned his commission some months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这不是我要问的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't the answer to the question I asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克特勋爵 你的问题不会被回答的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Beckett. In the category of questions not answered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们归国王陛下在皇家港的总督管辖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are under the jurisdiction of the king's governor of Port Royal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得说清楚我们的罪名是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will tell us what we are charged with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:49.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罪名是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The charge is "conspiring to set free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:53.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阴谋释放一名触犯了帝国法律的死囚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a man convicted of crimes against the Crown and Empire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而对此...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and condemned to death, for which the..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:01.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而对此的惩罚 很遗憾 也是死刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For which the punishment, regrettably, is also death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:07.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们还记得某个 名叫杰克·斯派洛的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you remember a certain pirate named Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我就知道你们记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I thought you might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:25.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 亡灵箱上十五人坐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Fifteen men on a dead man's chest ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 嘿呦吼吼 来瓶朗姆酒 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo-ho-ho and a bottle of rum ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 干一杯啊 剩下的留给魔鬼 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Drink and the devil had done for the rest ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:40.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 嘿呦吼吼 来瓶朗姆酒 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo-ho-ho and a bottle of rum ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,囚犯们 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoners, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:45.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 对不起啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,介意伴我一游吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if we make a little side trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你不会介意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.99,0:07:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 似乎计划有变啊? - 临时有变 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not quite according to plan. - Complications arose, ensued,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:06.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还好我随机应变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were overcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到要找的东西了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got what you went in for, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:16.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长 我觉得船员们 也包括我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I think the crew, meaning me as well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要些亮闪闪的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were expecting something a bit more shiny,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:24.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果死亡岛 带着上面的财宝 又沉入大海怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the lsla de Muerta going pear-shaped, reclaimed by the sea with the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,皇家海军还在满大西洋上追我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Royal Navy chasing us around the Atlantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:29.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有飓风 - 是啊 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the hurricane. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 我们似乎有一阵没干海盗的本行啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in all, it seems some time since we did a speck of honest pirating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:39.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闪亮的? - 没错 闪亮的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shiny. - Aye, shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们想要的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how you're all feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:48.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许老杰克没兴趣当你们的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That perhaps dear old Jack is not serving your best interests as captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 走木板吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk the plank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那鸟说啥? - 别怨鸟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did the bird say? - Do not blame the bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们看看那块布上有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show us what is on that piece of cloth there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:08.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这么干可不好 - 对我来说不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know that don't do no good. - It does me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是把钥匙 - 不 钥匙怎么比得上这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a key. - No. Much more better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:18.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是一把钥匙的图样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a drawing of a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙是用来干嘛的呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do keys do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:33.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能开锁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unlock things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:37.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管这钥匙开的是什么锁 里面一定有值钱的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whatever this key unlocks, inside there's something valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要出发找到这钥匙能开的锁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're setting out to find whatever this key unlocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:47.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有它 不管那是什么锁 我们也打不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't have the key, we can't open whatever we don't have that it unlocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不先搞到钥匙 找到锁又有何用?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what purpose would be served in finding whatever need be unlocked,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,且不说咱们手上还没锁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which we don't have, without first having found the key what unlocks it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:58.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说...我们要找钥匙罗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're going after this key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:01.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的话完全不合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not making any sense at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那 我们有航向吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do we have a heading?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 航向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,升帆向...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set sail in a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大概...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}general{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朝那个方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that-way direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:29.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点起航 你们知道怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, snap to and make sail. You know how this works. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你注意到了没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you noticed lately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:39.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长好像有点怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the captain seems to be acting a bit strange... er?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连航向都不知道就起航{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Setting sail without knowing his own heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有什么东西让他心事重重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's got Jack vexed, and mark my words,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要我说 杰克·斯派洛都不知所措 一定不是好兆头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what bodes ill for Jack Sparrow bodes ill for us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克特勋爵 囚犯带到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Beckett, the prisoner as ordered, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去掉镣铐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:17.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,东印度公司需要你的服务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The East lndia Trading Company has need of your services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你可以作为我们的代理人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wish for you to act as our agent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:27.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和我们共同的朋友斯派洛船长谈笔生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a business transaction with our mutual friend Captain Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:30.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是认识 谈不上是朋友 你怎么认识他的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More acquaintance. How do you know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:33.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们过去打过交道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had dealings in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都给对方留下了自己的印记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we've each left our mark on the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:40.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他给你留下什么印记了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mark did he leave on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:46.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你 杰克·斯派洛才得到自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By your efforts, Jack Sparrow was set free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要你找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like you to go to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:53.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从他那拿件财物回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and recover a certain property in his possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿回? 用剑逼他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recover. At the point of a sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:58.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,私掠许可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letters of marque.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的刑罚将被完全赦免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will offer what amounts to a full pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克将获得自由 成为英国雇佣的私掠船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack will be free, a privateer in the employ of England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:20.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点怀疑杰克会认为 雇佣等同于自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I doubt Jack will consider employment the same as being free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:27.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛这类人必将消亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow is a dying breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世界越来越小了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is shrinking,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地图边界的上空白越来越少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the blank edges of the map filled in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克要不就在新世界找到自己的位置 不然就死路一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack must find his place in the New World or perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.87,0:11:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和他不同 特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unlike you, Mr Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:42.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你的未婚妻将面临绞刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your fiancee face the hangman's noose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:48.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是说杰克和黑珍珠号你都要? - 黑珍珠号?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you get Jack and the Black Pearl. - The Black Pearl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要他的船 - 一条船?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The property you want that he possesses. - A ship? Hardly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:56.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要的东西要小得多 但也值钱得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The item in question is considerably smaller and far more valuable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:12:00.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛总是随身带着的一件东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something Sparrow keeps on his person at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个罗盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A compass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:05.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这件东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:10.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把那罗盘弄回来 不然这交易就作废{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring back that compass or there's no deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么朗姆酒总是喝光?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is the rum always gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来这么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you were, gents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时光飞逝啊 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's run out, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系带王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bootstrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔·特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去不错啊 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look good, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是梦吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想也不是 不然就会有朗姆酒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought not. If it were, there'd be rum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你夺回"珍珠"了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the Pearl back, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人帮我夺回了"珍珠"号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had some help retrieving the Pearl, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:37.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:43.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后还是干上了海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ended up a pirate after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你这老瘤子什么情吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to what do I owe the pleasure of your carbuncle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是"他"派我来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:54.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Davy Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原来是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's you, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把你骗上贼船的 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shanghaied you into service, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我选的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:11.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 针对你的那次叛乱中 我没干什么好事 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for the part I played in the mutiny against you, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:14.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是支持你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stood up for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:17.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那之后一切都乱套了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything went wrong after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:24.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我绑到一尊大炮上 沉到海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They strapped me to a cannon. I ended up on the bottom of the ocean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海水压得我死死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the weight of the water crushing down on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:30.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动也动不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unable to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死也死不成 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unable to die, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:39.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是一丝能摆脱这种命运的机会 我也会抓住不放的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought that even the tiniest hope of escaping this fate, I would take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会用一切来交换的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would trade anything for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:47.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人为了逃避最终审判 真是什么事都干得出啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny what a man will do to forestall his final judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也和他做了交易 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a deal with him too, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他替你将"珍珠"号从海底拉了上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He raised the Pearl from the depths for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:54.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是做了它13年的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}13 years, you've been her captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准确来说... - 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Technically... - Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,靠嘴皮子你是甩不脱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be able to talk yourself out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我适用的条款 对你也适用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The terms what applied to me apply to you as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:06.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个灵魂 注定要在这船上服务一百年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One soul bound to crew 100 years upon his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"飞翔的荷兰人" 已经有个船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Flying Dutchman already has a captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你也跑不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's the locker for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯的大海怪会找到你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones's terrible leviathan will find you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:19.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你和"珍珠"号一起拖回海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drag the Pearl back to the depths and you along with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:24.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道琼斯什么时候 会派所谓的大海怪来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea when Jones might release said terrible beastie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你了 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already told you, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的劫数已尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your time is up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它现在就来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It comes now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如饿鬼般的贪婪 直奔带有黑斑的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drawn with ravenous hunger to the man what bears the black spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:52.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人上甲板 赶快拉紧束帆索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On deck, all hands! Make fast the bunt gasket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:54.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小子们 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On deck! Scurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:59.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快起航{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry! I want movement! Movement! I want movement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起帆 稳舵 扬帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift the skin up! Keep your loof! Haul those sheets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跑 快跑 恶魔就追在我们后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run them! Run! Keep running! Run as if the devil himself and itself is upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们有航向吗? - 启动 朝向陆地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do we have a heading? - Run! Land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:20.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪个港口? - 我没说港口 我说的是陆地 任何陆地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which port? - I didn't say "port", I said "land". Any land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杰克的帽子 弄上来 - 别 别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack's hat! Bring her about! - No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别管那个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:35.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:39.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到岗位上去 都回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to your stations, the lot of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:55.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在圣母和圣子的份上 到底是什么东西在追我们啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the love of mother and child, Jack, what's coming after us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不能待在这儿 - 你会知道他可以待在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, now, you can't be here. - I think you'll find he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯旺先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Swann!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是斯旺总督{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Governor Swann, still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我戴这头假发是为了保暖吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I wear this wig to keep my head warm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:25.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克的罗盘? 贝克特要那东西干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack's compass? What does Beckett want with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无关紧要 我要去找到杰克 说服他回皇家港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter? I'm to find Jack and convince him to return to Port Royal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样对我们的起诉就能撤销{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exchange, the charges against us will be dropped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:35.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你们能否获得自由 不能操于他人之手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We must find our own avenue to secure your freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是对杰克没信心 还是对我没信心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a lack of faith in Jack or in me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意牺牲自己的性命去救斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you would risk your life to save Sparrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:44.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不意味着他愿意为其他人做同样的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does not mean he would do the same for anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那条有钥匙的狗跑哪去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where is that dog with the keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你们有信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have faith in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到哪去找他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从托图加岛找起 不找到他绝不罢休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tortuga. I'll start there and I won't stop searching till I find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:08.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会回来这里娶你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I intend to return here to marry you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.13,0:20:11.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 正式的? - 明媒正娶 如果你还要我的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Properly? - Eagerly, if you'll still have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:16.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是这铁栏杆 我早就是你的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it weren't for these bars, I'd have you already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:27.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会等你的 - 盯着海平线吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll wait for you. - Keep a weather eye on the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:39.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛船长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:44.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欠我4个金币 听说他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owes me four doubloons. Heard he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:48.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说在新加坡 喝醉了 当时他脸上还带着笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Singapore. That's what I heard. Drunk, with a smile on his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确信 杰克·斯派洛在新加坡出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure as the tide, Jack Sparrow turn up in Singapore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个月没见他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen him in a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:01.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等你找到他 帮我带个口信给他好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you find him, will you give him a message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:04.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克的事我说不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't say about Jack Sparrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但离海峡南面不远处有个小岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's an island just south of the straits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:10.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里用香料换...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I trade spice for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:12.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喷香的羊肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}delicious long pork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克我说不好 但你能在那找到一条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cannot say about Jack, but you'll find a ship there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:20.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一条挂黑帆的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ship with black sails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫人带你上岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother will take you ashore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:43.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么问题吗? 那儿就是海滩了 - [法语]{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? The beach is there. - C'est trop dangereux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:47.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - [法语]{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - C'est trop dangereux. je vous l'avais dit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[法语] 再见 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bon voyage. monsieur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:18.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.57,0:22:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.33,0:22:31.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cotton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:41.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,熟面孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A familiar face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.05,0:22:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.93,0:22:46.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不会吃你的 - 别吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not going to eat you. - Don't eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:49.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 别吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:02.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 谁想来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Who wants it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我整天都可以战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do this all day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:50.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.92,0:24:53.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能见到你我真是太高兴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can honestly say I'm glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:06.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 是我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.82,0:25:08.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔·特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.75,0:25:17.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们把我放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to let me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:38.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 那个罗盘 我只要那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, the compass. That's all I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:41.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白有危险 我们因为帮你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth is in danger. We were arrested for helping you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.03,0:25:44.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她会上绞架的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She faces the gallows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.09,0:26:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:04.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你对他们说什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, what did you tell them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.77,0:26:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.61,0:26:11.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.69,0:26:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个好女孩 走进来些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good girl. Come a little closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.36,0:26:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们不咬 - 过来 我们不咬你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't bite. - Go on. We won't bite you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.25,0:26:25.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我发生什么了? - 我们还有一点名气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me what's happening. - Our name still has some standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:32.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我安排你去英格兰 船长是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've arranged passage to England. The captain is a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:34.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 威尔会找到杰克的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Will's gone to find Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.97,0:26:37.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能指望威廉·特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot count on William Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:40.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点 - 他比你想像的要强得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come! - He's better than you give him credit for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.35,0:26:43.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在没时间讨论他 贝克特只愿意赦免一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no time for innocence. Beckett has offered one pardon only...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.86,0:26:46.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是对杰克·斯派洛的承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one, and that is promised to Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.28,0:26:47.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使威尔成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if Will succeeds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.07,0:26:54.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不能让我 亲眼看我的女儿去送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do not ask me to endure the sight of my daughter walking to the gallows. Do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许 等威尔回来的时候 我可以保证对他进行公平的审判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I can ensure a fair trial for Will if he returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.75,0:27:03.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对他的公平审判就是要吊死他 - 到时 你就没什么你牵挂的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A fair trial for Will ends in a hanging. - Then there is nothing left for you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.97,0:27:13.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在里面等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.23,0:27:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.73,0:27:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.53,0:27:28.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 总督大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, Governor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.95,0:27:30.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame, that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.04,0:27:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他随身带着这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was carrying this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:35.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一封给国王的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a letter to the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:38.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你写的 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's from you. - No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:43.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.68,0:27:47.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:52.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她在哪? - 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is she? - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.01,0:28:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你已经意识到忠诚没什么用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you've discovered that loyalty is no longer the currency of the realm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.30,0:28:16.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不像你父亲那个死脑筋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as your father believes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.39,0:28:20.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那什么才有用呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.14,0:28:23.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕只有金钱才能通行无阻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid currency is the currency of the realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:28.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这样我们应该能达成某种共识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect, then, we can come to some sort of understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.86,0:28:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是来谈判的 - 我在听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm here to negotiate. - I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在仔细地听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm listening intently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.79,0:28:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些私掠许可是国王签署的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These letters of marque are signed by the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不过没有我签字盖章 它们就不生效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and they're not valid until they bear my signature and my seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.13,0:28:48.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我也不会还待在这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or else I would not still be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:52.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你派威尔去找杰克·斯派洛要罗盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent Will to get you the compass owned by Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.06,0:28:56.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这对你不会有好处 - 请解释一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It will do you no good. - Do explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.86,0:29:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去过死亡之岛 我亲眼见过那些财宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been to the lsla de Muerta. I have seen the treasure myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.74,0:29:05.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有些东西你需要了解 - 我懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is something you need to know. - I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.08,0:29:09.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那罗盘只是指向死亡之岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the compass leads only to the lsla de Muerta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:12.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你希望能挽救我免遭厄运困扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so you hope to save me from an evil fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:15.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不用担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you mustn't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.17,0:29:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要那受诅咒的阿兹特克黄金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I care not for cursed Aztec gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:22.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼光没有那么短浅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My desires are not so provincial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.85,0:29:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这片水域中 值钱的箱子不只一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more than one chest of value in these waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.40,0:29:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我认为你应该提高出价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So perhaps you may wish to enhance your offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:39.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,计算的时候别忘了 你还搅了我的新婚之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider into your calculations that you robbed me of my wedding night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.87,0:29:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.96,0:29:46.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼横遭打断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A marriage interrupted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.59,0:29:51.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是否天意如此呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or fate intervenes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.01,0:29:55.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在尽力确保杰克·斯派洛的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making great efforts to ensure Jack Sparrow's freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.39,0:29:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不仅仅是为了杰克 - 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These aren't going to Jack. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:30:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要想确保特纳先生的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ensure Mr Turner's freedom, then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.65,0:30:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是要那个罗盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll still want that compass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.48,0:30:08.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,计算的时候别忘了这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider that in your calculations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:30.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得能从监狱逃走 是上帝保佑的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say it was Divine Providence what escaped us from jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.89,0:30:33.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得幸亏是我比较聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I say it was me being clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.85,0:30:37.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不对 普奇?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't that right, poochie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道你的小聪明 就不是上帝保佑的结果?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how'd you know it weren't Divine Providence what inspired you to be clever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.77,0:30:43.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 我再不偷别人的船了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyways, I ain't stealing no ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.03,0:30:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是偷 是救援 什么时候你开始在意这个了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't stealing. It's salvaging. And since when did you care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.41,0:30:54.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我们不再是不死之身 我们得考虑一下世俗的灵魂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since we're not immortal no more. We gotta take care of our immortal souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.12,0:30:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道你也看不懂 - 这可是圣经 试着读也会有奖励的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know you can't read. - It's the Bible. You get credit for trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装作在读圣经是一种谎言 这种行为会触怒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretending to read the Bible's a lie. That's a mark against...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:07.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:09.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.89,0:31:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它倒底怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's got into him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.02,0:31:18.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是见到鲶鱼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have seen a catfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:27.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid mongrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.34,0:31:45.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:56.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这归我们啦 - 正巧涨潮了 大好时机啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's ours for the taking. - Tide's coming in. That should help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.77,0:31:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从某种角度来说 救援船也是救赎啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And salvaging is saving, in a manner of speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.65,0:32:01.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the truth of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.08,0:32:12.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们应该尽快"救赎"它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose we better save it as soon as we can,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.17,0:32:15.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的肉体现在很脆弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what with our souls in such a vulnerable state and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.46,0:32:18.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:36.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.21,0:32:56.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他干嘛要这么对我们? 如果杰克是酋长的话?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he do this to us? If Jack is the chief...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.59,0:32:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,土著们的确让杰克作了酋长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, the Pelegostos made Jack their chief,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:02.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有酋长装得像样 他才能继续做下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he only remains chief as long as he acts like a chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:05.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说他别无选择 他像我们其他人一样也不过是个囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he had no choice. He's a captive as much as the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.02,0:33:12.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上是更糟 土著认为杰克是附体的神灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse, as it turns out. See, the Pelegostos believe that Jack is a god in human form,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.82,0:33:18.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要把他 从现在的肉体中释放出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they intend to do him the honour of releasing him from his fleshy prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.45,0:33:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把他烤来吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll roast him and eat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:27.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他船员哪里去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the rest of the crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.83,0:33:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关我们的这些笼子 是我们来了才造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These cages we're in weren't built till after we got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.72,0:33:36.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宴会就要开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The feast is about to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:39.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鼓声一停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack's life will end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:42.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克就要没命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the drums stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.85,0:33:46.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们不能就待在这等着吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can't just sit here and wait, then, can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Oi! No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.65,0:33:54.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多弄点木头来 燃大火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More wood. Big fire. Big fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.86,0:33:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是酋长 要燃大火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Chief. Want big fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:33:59.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.29,0:34:04.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,木头 快点 多弄点木头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tout de suite. Come on. More wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.58,0:35:15.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.26,0:35:27.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得调调味 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little seasoning, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.23,0:35:42.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.20,0:36:25.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把腿伸出去 开始爬啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your legs through. Start to climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:30.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 驾驶"黑珍珠" 需要这里所有的人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, men! It'll take all of us to crew the Black Pearl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实不需要那么多人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, you wouldn't need everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.71,0:36:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有六个就足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About six would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.63,0:36:41.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快啊 - 快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.31,0:36:53.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 你们就这么点本事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Is that all you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.36,0:37:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.41,0:37:06.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们在在做什么? - 停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they doing? - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:29.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.12,0:37:48.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.16,0:38:17.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去啊 去抓住他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go on, go get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.91,0:38:25.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Oi! No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:29.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.44,0:38:47.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找石头把它切断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it loose! Find a rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.67,0:39:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让笼子滚起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll the cage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:10.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:40.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点把笼子抬起来 - 快提起来 就像提女人的裙子一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lift the cage! Hurry! - Come on, lads. Lift it like a lady's skirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.61,0:40:37.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.71,0:40:54.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, lads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.99,0:41:18.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.70,0:41:21.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.31,0:42:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.35,0:42:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起驳船缆绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haul loose the mooring line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.10,0:42:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,缆绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mooring line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.44,0:42:54.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小偷 毛头小偷 还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thief! Little hairy thief! Give it back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.19,0:42:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要咬 - 拉起驳船缆绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't bite it! - Haul loose the mooring line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.03,0:43:00.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿走我的眼睛不还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got me eye. He won't give it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.24,0:43:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们下次再拿回来 可以吗? - 非常好 我们的工作完成一半了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you get it back last time? - Excellent! Our work's half done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.78,0:43:06.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是为你做的 知道你会回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We done it for you, knowing you'd be coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.37,0:43:09.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备开船 伙计们 - 杰克呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make ready to sail, boys! - What about Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.38,0:43:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能丢下他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't leave without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.85,0:43:23.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 该走了 - 放下缆绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Time to go. - Cast off those lines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.53,0:43:34.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下缆绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make ready to cast off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.16,0:43:41.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖狗狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good doggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.93,0:44:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该永远记住今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alas, my children, this is the day you shall always remember as the day you almost...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.36,0:44:08.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们差点捉到杰克·斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.35,0:44:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们赶快远离这座岛并航向大海吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get away from this island and head out to open sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.52,0:44:42.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我同意 我同意 但我们不能离开浅滩太远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes to the first. Yes to the second, but only insofar as we keep to the shallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这似乎有点矛盾 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That seems a bit contradictory, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.32,0:44:47.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你的"和解式"导航法相当有信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have faith in your reconciliatory navigational skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.58,0:44:50.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只猴子跑哪去了 我想找它练靶子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where is that monkey? I want to shoot something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.34,0:44:58.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 伊莉莎白有危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack. Elizabeth is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.80,0:45:01.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有考虑过把她关起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you considered just locking her up somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.68,0:45:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她为了你现在被捉起来 即将被吊死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is locked up, bound to hang for helping you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.31,0:45:09.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候人必须为了自己做错的事负责的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There comes a time when one must take responsibility for one's mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.56,0:45:12.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的罗盘 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need that compass of yours, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.07,0:45:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要拿它去换取她的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must trade it for her freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.95,0:45:20.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉布斯 - 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Gibbs. - Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.70,0:45:23.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要沿河逆流而上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a need to travel upriver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.83,0:45:27.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的"需要"是否只是你 一时兴起想到的小小愿望呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By need, do you mean a trifling need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.42,0:45:31.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我指的是很肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fleeting? As in, say, a passing fancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.30,0:45:35.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不可更改的"需要"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, a resolute and unyielding need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.18,0:45:38.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在需要的是即刻回到皇家港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we need to do is make sail for Port Royal with all haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.06,0:45:40.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.06,0:45:43.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把罗盘给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall trade you the compass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you will help me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.11,0:45:47.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我找到这个的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.95,0:45:53.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要我帮你找这个? - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want me to find this? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己想要找这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want you to find this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:46:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为找到这个的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the finding of this finds you incapacitorially finding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.29,0:46:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你便会在无尽的探索中发现到 解救你那位小甜心的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and/or locating in your discovering a way to save your dolly belle, ol' what's-her-face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.09,0:46:10.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.34,0:46:14.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个东西可以解救伊莉莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to save Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.18,0:46:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对戴维·琼斯了解多少?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you know about Davy Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.48,0:46:24.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.15,0:46:27.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这东西可以救伊莉莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's going to save Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.48,0:46:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么飞机?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.69,0:47:01.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都那么喜欢那件洋装的话 就轮流穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you both fancy the dress, you'll just have to share and wear it one after the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.82,0:47:05.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的 船长 这艘船闹鬼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like that, sir. This ship is haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.70,0:47:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it, now? And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这船上有个女鬼 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a female presence amongst us here, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都感觉到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the men, they can feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.88,0:47:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是一位还未结婚便成了寡妇的女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the ghost of a lady widowed before her marriage, I figure it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.72,0:47:21.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来这船上找她死在海上的丈夫了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}searching for her husband, lost at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.09,0:47:23.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还是个处女 可能也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A virgin too, likely as not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:26.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是厄运之兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that bodes ill by all accounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.10,0:47:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议我们把这衣服丢下海 祈祷女鬼会跟着一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say that we throw the dress overboard and we hope the spirit follows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.69,0:47:33.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 那只会激怒她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! That will just anger the spirit, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.61,0:47:37.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应搞清楚她想要什么 助她达成愿望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we need to do is find out what the spirit needs, and then get it back to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.74,0:47:39.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.08,0:47:44.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们已经迷信到昏头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pair of superstitious goats and it's got the best of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:47.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由这看来我们船上来了一位不速之客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this appears to be no more as we have a stowaway on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.75,0:47:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个年轻女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young woman, by the look of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.00,0:47:52.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们搜索全船把她找出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to search the ship and find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.72,0:47:55.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 她大概是一丝不挂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and she's probably naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.38,0:48:28.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何杰克这么怕大海?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is Jack afraid of the open ocean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.09,0:48:30.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 有这么一个传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you believe such things,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.97,0:48:33.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯的手下有一只怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a beast does the bidding of Davy Jones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.85,0:48:38.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它有着巨大的触手 一下就能把你的脸给吸下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fearsome creature with giant tentacles that'll suction your face clean off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.52,0:48:42.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把整艘船拉进海底深渊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drag an entire ship down to the crushing darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.78,0:48:45.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,挪威海怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kraken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.20,0:48:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就连它的呼吸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say the stench of its breath is like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:55.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想像你临死之前听到的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine, the last thing you know on God's green earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.79,0:49:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是它震耳欲聋的咆哮 闻到的是它腐尸般恶臭的呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the roar of the kraken and the reeking odour of a thousand rotting corpses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你相信这传说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believe such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.64,0:49:09.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙可以帮他解脱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the key will spare him that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:12.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那正是杰克想知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's the very question Jack wants answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.73,0:49:15.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不惜去问"她"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad enough even to go visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.15,0:49:18.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"她"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.31,0:49:20.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.27,0:49:22.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.28,0:50:00.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 兄弟们 我跟蒂亚会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No worries, mates. Tia Dalma and I go way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.07,0:50:05.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是如此地分不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thick as thieves. Nigh inseparable, we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.11,0:50:07.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were. Have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.62,0:50:09.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.74,0:50:12.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会帮你提防后面 - 我怕的是她从正面来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll watch your back. - It's me front I'm worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.79,0:50:15.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看好船 - 看好船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind the boat. - Mind the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.12,0:50:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看好船 - 看好船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind the boat. - Mind the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.71,0:50:20.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看好船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.96,0:50:23.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看好船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.88,0:50:38.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.26,0:50:40.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,提亚·朵玛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tia Dalma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.18,0:50:45.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道总有一天风会把你吹回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always knew the wind was going to blow you back to me one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.44,0:50:52.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.81,0:50:57.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对你的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a touch of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.52,0:51:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有预感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}destiny about you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.98,0:51:02.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉·特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.61,0:51:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:09.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想认识我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.57,0:51:14.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有求而来 不达目的是不会走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be no knowing here. We've come for help and we're not leaving without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.28,0:51:17.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我以为我已经认识你 - 似乎不如我预期的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought I knew you. - Not so well as I had hoped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.04,0:51:20.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来 - 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come. - Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.92,0:51:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能怎样为你效劳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What service may I do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.13,0:51:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我需要报酬的 - 我带了报酬来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know I demand payment. - I brought payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.67,0:51:38.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.84,0:51:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不死猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An undead monkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.35,0:51:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搁在上面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.43,0:51:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 你不知道我们花了多久才抓到它的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! You've no idea how long it took us to catch that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.81,0:51:55.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个报酬很合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The payment is fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.40,0:51:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.94,0:52:02.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有它所开启的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what it goes to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.23,0:52:08.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前从我这里得到的罗盘 无法帮你找到这钥匙的所在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The compass you bartered from me, it cannot lead you to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.99,0:52:12.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许可以 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.91,0:52:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛也不知道自己在找什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow does not know what he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.00,0:52:22.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.37,0:52:26.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却不愿自己承认 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but are loath to claim it as your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.00,0:52:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这把钥匙可以开启一个宝箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your key go to a chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.63,0:52:35.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝箱里的东西才是你们在寻找的 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is what lay inside the chest you seek, don't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.26,0:52:38.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 里面到底是什么 - 金子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is inside? - Gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.26,0:52:42.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,珠宝? 或无人认领的贵重物品?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewels? Unclaimed properties of a valuable nature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.43,0:52:45.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望 不是什么坏东西吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing bad, I hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.35,0:52:49.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道戴维·琼斯吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know of Davy Jones,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.31,0:52:50.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.93,0:52:53.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个海员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man of the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.81,0:52:56.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个很棒的水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great sailor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.19,0:53:01.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到他碰上了一个 让任何男人都苦恼的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until he run afoul of that which vex all men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.27,0:53:04.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么让任何男人都苦恼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What vexes all men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.82,0:53:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.86,0:53:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大海 - 宝物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The sea. - Sums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.95,0:53:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正义与邪恶的集合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dichotomy of good and evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.57,0:53:16.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.58,0:53:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.28,0:53:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个他爱上的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.45,0:53:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我听说的是他爱上了大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no. I heard it was the sea he fell in love with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.50,0:53:27.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同样的故事 不同的版本 不过都是正确的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same story, different versions, and all are true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.54,0:53:29.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他爱上的那个女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, it was a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.00,0:53:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就如同大海般易变、残酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as changing and harsh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.84,0:53:36.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无法驯服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and untamable as the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.34,0:53:38.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从没停止爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him never stopped loving her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:43.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是这样的爱为他带来了极大痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the pain it cause him was too much to live with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.72,0:53:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却又不至于痛到取走他的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not enough to cause him to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.18,0:53:52.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底把什么放在宝箱里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly did he put into the chest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.72,0:53:54.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.77,0:53:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的还是在比喻?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally or figuratively?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.94,0:54:01.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么可能真的把他的心放在宝箱里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't literally put his heart in a chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.56,0:54:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.65,0:54:09.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得爱得这么痛苦太不值得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not worth feeling what small, fleeting joy life brings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.82,0:54:11.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,于是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.57,0:54:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他挖出了他的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}him carve out him heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.86,0:54:19.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将它锁进了宝箱 再把宝箱藏了起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iock it away in a chest and hide the chest from the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.45,0:54:22.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.62,0:54:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他寸步不离地带在身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he keep with him at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:31.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你早就知道了吧 - 我不知道 我原本不知道钥匙在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You knew this. - I did not. I didn't know where the key was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.58,0:54:35.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在剩下的就是去找到"飞行荷兰人" 拿了钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now we do. All that's left is to climb aboard the Flying Dutchman, grab the key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.88,0:54:38.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到皇家港 救出你的甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go back to Port Royal and save your bonnie lass, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.71,0:54:41.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看你的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.14,0:54:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑斑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The black spot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.69,0:55:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 黑斑 - 黑斑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The black spot! - Black spot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.65,0:55:05.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的视力还是跟以前一样好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyesight's as good as ever, just so you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.81,0:55:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有样东西 我把它放哪儿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have just the thing. Now, where did I put it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.74,0:55:16.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的小美丽 你在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My little beauty, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.32,0:55:19.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么长时间的混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a long time in such a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.91,0:55:24.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯不能上岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Davy Jones cannot make port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.87,0:55:28.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能上岸 他每十年才能踏上土地一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cannot step on land but once every ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.75,0:55:31.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在地上你才是安全的 杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land is where you are safe, Jack Sparrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.08,0:55:34.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你把土地带着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so you will carry land with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.88,0:55:45.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,泥土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.01,0:55:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是一罐泥土 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is a jar of dirt. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.01,0:55:55.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这罐泥土有用吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the jar of dirt going to help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.97,0:55:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想要的话就还我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't want it, give it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.39,0:56:02.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要 - 它会帮上忙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Then it helps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.77,0:56:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要找到"飞行荷兰人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems we have a need to find the Flying Dutchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.94,0:56:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,预测命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A touch of destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是"飞行荷兰人"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Flying Dutchman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.71,0:56:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看起来不怎么样 - 你看起来也不怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She doesn't look like much. - Neither do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.59,0:56:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别小看她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not underestimate her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.38,0:56:47.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它看起来好像触礁了 - 你打算怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Must have run afoul of the reef. - So, what's your plan, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.88,0:56:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我划小船过去 翻遍整艘船 直到找到你的钥匙为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I row over, search the ship until I find your bloody key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.43,0:56:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有船员呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there are crewmen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.89,0:56:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁挡路我就砍谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut down anyone in my path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.97,0:56:59.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 我喜欢 简单明了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it. Simple, easy to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.97,0:57:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你的战车等着你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chariot awaits you, Sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.48,0:57:13.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你被逮住了 就说 杰克·斯派洛派我来处理他的债务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do happen to get captured, just say Jack Sparrow sent you to settle his debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.32,0:57:17.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它能让你活命 - 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It might save your life. - Bon voyage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.20,0:57:23.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,熄灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Douse the lamps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:06.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.60,0:58:09.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 船长命令 扬帆 - 水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hoisting the jib, Captain's orders. - Sailor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.27,0:58:11.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扬起帆 掉头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoisting the jib. Bring up with a round turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.73,0:58:14.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有用 你们搁浅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no use. You've run aground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.52,0:58:15.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.98,0:58:18.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beneath us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.99,0:58:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有可怕的呼吸声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foul breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.94,0:59:16.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求饶祈祷吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down on your marrowbones and pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.70,0:59:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退开 退开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.23,1:00:10.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩五人活着 其他的都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five men still alive. The rest have moved on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.03,1:00:31.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕死吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you fear death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.62,1:00:37.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你畏惧那黑色深渊吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you fear that dark abyss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.34,1:00:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一生尽现于此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All your deeds laid bare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.05,1:00:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的罪行将被惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All your sins punished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.89,1:00:50.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can offer you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.47,1:00:52.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逃命的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.01,1:00:56.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别听他胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.73,1:01:07.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不怕死亡吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not fear death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.20,1:01:12.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁可冒这个险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take my chances, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.87,1:01:15.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丢下海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the depths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.75,1:01:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruel blackguard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.87,1:01:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生命是残酷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is cruel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.96,1:01:28.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死后的世界难道有什么不同吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should the afterlife be any different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.25,1:01:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你一个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer you a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.51,1:01:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加入我的团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join my crew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.30,1:01:37.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,推迟你的审判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and postpone the judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.05,1:01:42.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以多活一百年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred years before the mast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.85,1:01:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意加入吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will ye serve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.60,1:01:50.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will serve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.99,1:02:03.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没死 也不会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are neither dead nor dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.58,1:02:06.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何来这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your purpose here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.00,1:02:12.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛派我来处理他的债务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow sent me to settle his debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.29,1:02:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何来这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your purpose here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.63,1:02:19.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛派我来处理他的债务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow sent me to settle his debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.80,1:02:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.47,1:02:28.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个让人心动的提议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorely tempted to accept that offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.82,1:02:48.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要还债{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a debt to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.74,1:02:52.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了"黑珍珠"的船长十三年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been captain of the Black Pearl for 13 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.24,1:02:54.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们约好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was our agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.41,1:02:58.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确切地说我只做了两年 然后就被推翻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically I was only captain for two years, then I was mutinied upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.33,1:03:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个可怜的船长 但你还是船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you were a poor captain, but a captain nonetheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.21,1:03:05.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些年来你每次自我介绍时 不都自称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you not introduced yourself all these years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.55,1:03:08.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"杰克·斯派洛船长"吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Captain Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.09,1:03:14.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经赔付了给你 我已经送了个人给你当水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my payment. One soul to serve on your ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.14,1:03:16.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个灵魂不能混为一谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One soul is not equal to another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.47,1:03:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经达成了共识 接下来我们谈谈价钱吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've established my proposal is sound in principle. Now we're haggling over price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.10,1:03:26.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,价钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Price?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.69,1:03:32.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的灵魂需要多少人来换{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just how many souls do you think my soul is worth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.95,1:03:38.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一百人的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.53,1:03:41.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三天时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.83,1:03:45.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个宝 伙计 你把那孩子送回来我们马上去办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a diamond, mate. Send me back the boy. I'll get started right off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.79,1:03:48.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把这孩子留做保证金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep the boy. A good-faith payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.00,1:03:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再给我99人就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That leaves you only 99 more to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.71,1:03:56.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有遇见威尔·特纳吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you not met Will Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.80,1:03:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正直、英勇 还是个娘娘腔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's noble, heroic, a terrific soprano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.72,1:04:02.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少可抵四个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worth at least four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.18,1:04:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许三个半人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe three and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.22,1:04:08.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有没有提到过?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And did I happen to mention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.31,1:04:10.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正在热恋中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's in love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.60,1:04:14.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和一个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.31,1:04:16.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即将要成婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Due to be married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.82,1:04:18.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经订婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrothed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.74,1:04:24.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,硬生生把他和他的爱人拆散 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dividing him from her and her from him would only be half as cruel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.53,1:04:29.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会比让他们成婚还更残酷吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as actually allowing them to be joined in holy matrimony. Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.37,1:04:38.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要留着他 你再给我99个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep the boy. 99 souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.34,1:04:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wonder, Sparrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.09,1:04:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你良心能安稳吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you live with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.05,1:04:47.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能宣判一个无辜的人 一个朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you condemn an innocent man, a friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:52.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宣判他无期徒刑 而你自己却在享受自由吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a lifetime of servitude in your name while you roam free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.14,1:04:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. I'm good with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.27,1:05:01.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要滴血...墨为盟吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we seal it in blood? I mean ink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.73,1:05:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三天时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.99,1:05:15.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三天时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.75,1:05:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉布斯 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Gibbs. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.75,1:05:28.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然觉得跟平常不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel sullied and unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.46,1:05:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么在三天内找到99人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you intend to harvest these 99 souls in three days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.34,1:05:40.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是 他并没有提及他要的是什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, he was mum as to the condition in which these souls need be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.47,1:05:42.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,托图加岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tortuga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.52,1:05:44.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,托图加岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tortuga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.98,1:05:52.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是侮辱 港口税 船棚费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an outrage. Port tariffs, berthing fees,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.69,1:05:55.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,处理费 上帝啊 还有导航费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wharf handling and, heaven help us, pilotage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.03,1:06:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的得为东印度公司工作吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we all to work for the East lndia Trading Company, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.49,1:06:04.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长 现在完全免费的港口只剩托图加岛了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid, sir, Tortuga is the only free port left in these waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.04,1:06:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指那个海盗港 嗯 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pirate port is what you mean. Well, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.75,1:06:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个诚实的航海员 我做的是正当的生意 晚上我睡觉才安稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An honest sailor is what I am. I make my living fair and I sleep well each night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.92,1:06:15.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.11,1:06:41.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她想叫你做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants you to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.78,1:06:47.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她好像在给我们什么暗示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's trying to give a sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.83,1:06:58.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那边 找找看有什么暗示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there! Look for a sign!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.09,1:07:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那边 找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there! There it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.71,1:07:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她给的暗示 - 那是海草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's the sign! - That's seaweed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.38,1:07:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 海草也可以是个暗示吧 - 我看像是什么生物的内脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seaweed can be a sign. - Looks like entrails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.55,1:07:16.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是不好的预兆 - 那是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That would be a bad sign. - What's that over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.72,1:07:23.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(托图加岛)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何认为自己 可以成为"黑珍珠"的一员呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what makes you think you're worthy to crew the Black Pearl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.24,1:07:40.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有乘过船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never sailed a day in me life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.58,1:07:43.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想趁还年轻时多看看世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure I should get out, see the world while I'm still young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.83,1:07:47.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好 请签字 下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll do. Make your mark. Next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.29,1:07:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我太太带着我的狗 跟人跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife ran off with my dog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.42,1:07:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经醉了一个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm drunk for a month{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.96,1:07:55.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我对自己是死是活 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't give an ass rat's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.13,1:07:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经不在乎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I live or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:08:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 非常好 下一位 - 我知道我需要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perfect. Next! - I knowwhat I want. I knowwhat I want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.30,1:08:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只有一只手 且脚是跛的 - 这是给你乌鸦巢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me have one arm and a bum leg. - It's the crow's nest for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.51,1:08:06.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道我要的是什么 - 下一位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I knowwhat I want. - Next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.97,1:08:12.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从小就想当个水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since I was a little lad, I've always wanted to sail the seas forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.68,1:08:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的梦想就快实现了 请签字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner than you think. Sign the roster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.47,1:08:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.85,1:08:23.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 招到几个了? - 包括刚才那四个 一共四个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How we going? - lncluding those four, that gives us four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.48,1:08:28.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又有什么故事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's your story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.74,1:08:31.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.32,1:08:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的故事就和你的故事一样 只不过慢你一章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's exactly the same as your story, just one chapter behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.49,1:08:40.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为了追缉一个人 航遍了七海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chased a man across the seven seas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.20,1:08:43.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这漫长的追赶 使得我失去了我的船员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pursuit cost me my crew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.12,1:08:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的军衔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my commission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.88,1:08:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及我的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.09,1:08:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 司令官? - 我已经不是司令官了 你没听到我说的话吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commodore? - No, not any more. Weren't you listening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.93,1:09:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在的黎波里 我差点就捉到你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I nearly had you all off Tripoli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.27,1:09:08.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是因为那该死的飓风的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have, if not for the hurricane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.90,1:09:10.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.35,1:09:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是硬闯飓风吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't try to sail through it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:14.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底能不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, do I make your crew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.07,1:09:17.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加入你们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.90,1:09:20.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没说你们要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't said where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.74,1:09:22.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个好地方吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere nice?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.87,1:09:26.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底有没有这荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, am I worthy to serve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.37,1:09:29.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为杰克·斯派洛船长效劳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under Captain Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.62,1:09:35.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我现在就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or should I just kill you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.17,1:09:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你被录取了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:47.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 老习惯改不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Old habits and all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.51,1:09:51.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小心 水手 - 你枪指的是船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy, sailor! - That's our captain you're threatening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.24,1:10:06.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 该走了 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Time to go. - Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.94,1:10:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.67,1:11:00.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.90,1:11:10.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 你们谁想挨揍?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, then! Who wants some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.57,1:11:14.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,排成一列 我会一个个收拾你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form an orderly line and I'll have you all, one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.17,1:11:16.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来来来 谁先来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, who's first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.10,1:11:22.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想享受打昏他的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted the pleasure of doing that myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.34,1:11:52.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆士·诺灵顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Norrington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.93,1:11:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这世界对你做了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has the world done to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.22,1:12:26.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.73,1:12:28.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.61,1:12:31.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.87,1:12:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.83,1:12:38.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉起来 - 拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heave! - Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.18,1:12:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稳固桅杆 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure the mast tackle, Mr Turner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.20,1:12:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,栓紧它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set to it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.68,1:12:58.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让开 - 嘿 管好你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step aside. - Hey! Mind yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.02,1:13:01.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.08,1:13:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.23,1:13:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他绑起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haul that weevil to his feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.46,1:13:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赏你五鞭让你知道怎么服从命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five lashes will remind you to stay on 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.01,1:13:31.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要 - 居然敢违抗我的命令?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - lmpeding me in my duties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.19,1:13:35.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们都要受罚 - 罚我一个人就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll share the punishment. - I'll take it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.12,1:13:37.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.58,1:13:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候你变得这么有同情心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would prompt such an act of charity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.56,1:13:48.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.45,1:13:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.03,1:14:10.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的好巧呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What fortuitous circumstance be this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.42,1:14:14.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你代替我来赏他五鞭吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five lashes be owed, I believe it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.23,1:14:21.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I won't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.82,1:14:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生 只要在他背上快快抽五下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cat's out of the bag, Mr Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.04,1:14:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打他会比我或其它人打的更不疼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your issue will feel its sting, be it by the bosun's hand or your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.35,1:14:36.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.82,1:14:38.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 布舍尔 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bosun! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.10,1:15:26.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,便宜你了 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had it easy, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.61,1:15:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威尔 - 我不需要你的帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will. - I don't need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.33,1:15:37.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我 你一定被打得皮开肉绽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bosun prides himself on cleaving flesh from bone, with every swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.77,1:15:42.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来你打我都是为了我好啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm to understand what you did was an act of compassion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.82,1:15:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.55,1:15:56.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你服役的这一百年 你的肉体会渐渐剥落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 years before the mast, losing who you were, bit by bit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.52,1:16:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到你像可怜的威尔一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you end up... end up like poor Wyvern here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你宣誓为"飞行荷兰人"效忠后 这就是你必得的下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've sworn an oath to the Dutchman, there's no leaving it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.14,1:16:08.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到债务偿还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until your debt is paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.01,1:16:11.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有宣誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've sworn no oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.19,1:16:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该快点离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.41,1:16:18.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我找到这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until I find this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.21,1:16:22.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.31,1:16:31.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亡灵箱的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dead man's chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.91,1:16:35.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.12,1:16:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用那把钥匙打开宝箱 再一刀刺进那心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the chest with the key, and stab the heart...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.93,1:16:43.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 不能刺那心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't stab the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.45,1:16:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"飞行荷兰人"需要一个活的心脏 心脏死的话船长就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dutchman needs a living heart or there'll be no captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.59,1:16:52.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长死了的话就没人有钥匙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if there's no captain, there's no one to have the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.31,1:16:55.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说钥匙在船长身上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the captain has the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.11,1:16:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 钥匙在哪里? - 藏起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is the key? - Hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.29,1:17:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 宝箱又在哪里? - 藏起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is the chest? - Hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.26,1:17:08.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Sparrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.18,1:17:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来加入我的船队吗? 欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to join me crew, lad? Welcome aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.73,1:17:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来找我心爱的男人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to find the man I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.41,1:17:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我深感荣幸 可惜大海是我最爱 也是唯一的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm deeply flattered, son, but my first and only love is the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.09,1:17:24.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指威廉·特纳 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaning William Turner, Captain Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.31,1:17:25.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把朗姆酒藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide the rum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.28,1:17:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这套衣服一点都不适合你 要么穿女装 要么什么都不穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These clothes do not flatter you. It should be a dress or nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.24,1:17:34.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 刚好我的舱房里一件女装都没有 - 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I happen to have no dress in my cabin. - Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.55,1:17:39.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道威尔来找过你 他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Will came to find you. Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.89,1:17:43.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我实在很不愿意告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, I am truly unhappy to have to tell you this, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.52,1:17:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在一连串与我无关也无法预料的不幸事件中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through unfortunate circumstances that had nothing whatsoever to do with me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.54,1:17:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的威尔被戴维·琼斯抓去当水手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}poor Will has been press-ganged into Davy Jones's crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.31,1:17:58.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Davy Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.69,1:18:02.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.16,1:18:05.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是"飞行荷兰人"的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The captain of the Flying Dutchman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.71,1:18:09.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瞧你副德行 来我船上干吗? - 是你雇我来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look awful. What are you doing here? - You hired me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.17,1:18:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你雇佣标准这么低 这我也无能为力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help it if your standards are lax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:14.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你臭死了 - 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You smell funny. - Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.81,1:18:17.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想找到威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is to find Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.00,1:18:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确信? 真的很想找到他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you certain? Is that what you really want most?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.39,1:18:28.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.85,1:18:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,依我看你应该找的是 一个解救威尔的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I would think you'd want to find a way to save Will most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.74,1:18:37.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有办法是吗? - 是这样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you'd have a way of doing that? - Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.71,1:18:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有那么一个宝箱 - 哦 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- there is a chest. - Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.05,1:18:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它大小不知 地点不明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chest of unknown size and origin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.47,1:18:48.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面装的是 戴维·琼斯那颗仍然跳动的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What contains the still-beating heart of Davy Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.82,1:18:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要拥有这宝箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whoever possesses that chest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.74,1:18:55.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就能命令琼斯做任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}possesses the leverage to command Jones to do whatever it is he or she wants,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.80,1:19:00.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括从困境中解救勇敢的威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including saving brave William from his grim fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.81,1:19:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真的相信他这一套吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't actually believe him, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.66,1:19:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么才能找到它呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howwould we find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.18,1:19:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.10,1:19:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这罗盘世上独一无二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My compass is unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.56,1:19:21.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,独一无二? 你是说它失灵了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Unique" here having the meaning of "broken".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.78,1:19:27.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这个罗盘不会指向北{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True enough, this compass does not point north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.47,1:19:32.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那它指向哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does it point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.35,1:19:37.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它会指向这世上你最想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It points to the thing you want most in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.25,1:19:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.84,1:19:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是真的吗? - 句句属实 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you telling the truth? - Every word, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.68,1:19:50.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这世上你最想要的就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what you want most in this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.02,1:19:55.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯的亡灵箱 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to find the chest of Davy Jones, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.04,1:20:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去救威尔 - 先找到戴维·琼斯的亡灵箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To save Will. - By finding the chest of Davy Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.50,1:20:18.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉布斯先生 - 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Gibbs! - Cap'n.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.93,1:20:21.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有航向了 - 终于有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have our heading. - Finally!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.27,1:20:25.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,割断缆绳 向罗盘指示的方向前进 起锚 扬帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast off those lines. Weigh anchor and crowd that canvas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.95,1:20:27.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.21,1:20:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入我们的队伍 前司令官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the crew, former commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.27,1:20:45.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得通晓世界地理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something to knowing the exact shape of the world and one's place in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.25,1:20:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证 这些完全没有必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you, these are not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.05,1:20:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你关心你女儿的下落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd be interested in the whereabouts of your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.60,1:20:56.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有她的消息吗? - 不久前在托图加岛上出现过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have news of her? - Most recently seen on Tortuga,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.19,1:21:00.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来上了海盗杰克·斯派洛的贼船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then left in the company of a known pirate, Jack Sparrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.24,1:21:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这船上聚集的都是些法外之徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and other fugitives from justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.51,1:21:05.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法!哪里还有王法!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Justice"? Hardly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.43,1:21:11.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其中还包括这把剑的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including the previous owner of this sword, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.74,1:21:16.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经派出船只 正义将被重新伸张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ships are in pursuit. Justice will be dispensed by cannonade and cutlass,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.59,1:21:20.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到时候剑拔弩张 枪炮无眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all manner of remorseless pieces of metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.64,1:21:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,依我看 那贼船上的人恐怕性命难保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find it distasteful to even contemplate the horror facing all those on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.95,1:21:31.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想从我这里得到什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.88,1:21:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的地方管辖权 加上你在伦敦的影响力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your authority as governor, your influence in London,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.13,1:21:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且要你效忠于东印度公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your loyalty to the East lndia Trading Company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.77,1:21:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是效忠于你吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To you, you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.95,1:21:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要我帮你打开手铐吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I remove these shackles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.93,1:21:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽可能地帮我找女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you can for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.62,1:22:06.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 只要价位合适 几乎任何人都可以被收买{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you see, Mercer, every man has a price he will willingly accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.68,1:22:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕是他从不曾打算出卖的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for what he hoped never to sell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.86,1:22:18.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我赌十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wager ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.86,1:22:22.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你 我也赌十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll match ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.20,1:22:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.91,1:22:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么玩么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wondering how it's played?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.74,1:22:32.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 知道 - 开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I understand. - Liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.71,1:22:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一场欺诈的赌博 你赌所有骰子的点数 不光是自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a game of deception. But your bet includes all the dice, not just your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.67,1:22:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 赌注是什么? - 我们唯一拥有的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they wagering? - The only thing we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.80,1:22:44.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在船上服侍的年份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years of service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.30,1:22:50.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跟谁都可以对赌? - 是的 都可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So any crew member can be challenged? - Aye. Anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.39,1:22:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和戴维·琼斯赌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I challenge Davy Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.79,1:23:18.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I accept, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.30,1:23:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的赌注呢? - 我的灵魂 永远的被奴役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The stakes? - My soul. An eternity of servitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.94,1:23:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.31,1:23:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想赢什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.33,1:23:45.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.47,1:24:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是怎么知道这钥匙的? - 这与赌局无关 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know of the key? - That's not part of the game, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.56,1:24:08.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在放弃还不迟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can still walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.88,1:24:35.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这算什么? - 我也要赌 和他的赌注一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this? - I'm in. Matching his wager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.05,1:24:38.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.89,1:24:43.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏已经开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The die is cast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.76,1:24:46.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜3个二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bid three twos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.93,1:24:49.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该你了 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your bid, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:58.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,4个四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four fours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.51,1:25:10.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,4个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four fives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.72,1:25:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,6个三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six threes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.10,1:25:25.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,7个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven fives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.17,1:25:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,8个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight fives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.18,1:25:59.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎入队 年青人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the crew, lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.85,1:26:04.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,12个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve fives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.10,1:26:06.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,12个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve fives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.86,1:26:09.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我开 要不就继续加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me a liar, or up the bid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.03,1:26:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想让我放弃 承认自己输了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And be called a liar myself for my trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.08,1:26:22.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系带王比尔 你输了 今生今世都要呆在这船上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bootstrap Bill, you're a liar and you will spend an eternity on this ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.87,1:26:29.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生 想上岸的话随你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Turner, feel free to go ashore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.38,1:26:33.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要等到我们下次靠岸喽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the very next time we make port!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:44.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真傻 为什么要这么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fool. Why did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.20,1:26:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't let you lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.49,1:26:51.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关键并不在于输赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never about winning or losing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.62,1:26:55.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.75,1:26:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是想知道钥匙藏在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just wanted to know where it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.23,1:27:21.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长让我来换你的班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain says I'm to relieve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.86,1:27:27.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.78,1:29:20.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个也拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Take this, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.33,1:29:24.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到岸上去 不要再下海了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get yourself to land, and stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.17,1:29:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我命中注定要死在海上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always in my blood to die at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.51,1:29:31.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不希望你也有同样的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not a fate I ever wanted for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.31,1:29:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以不选择如此命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a fate you had to choose for yourself, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.10,1:29:46.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当初是不得已 才抛弃你去当海盗的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. I could say I did what I had to, when I left you to go pirating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.23,1:29:51.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是对你说谎并不是我所想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it would taste a lie to say it wasn't what I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.28,1:29:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 你不欠我什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me nothing, Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.03,1:29:58.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.37,1:30:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会知道是你帮了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll know you helped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.42,1:30:05.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还能把我怎么样呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What more can they do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.26,1:30:13.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以这把匕首向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take this with a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.59,1:30:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你从琼斯的魔爪中救出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find a way to sever Jones's hold on you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.10,1:30:19.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用这匕首刺入他的心绝不罢休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not rest until this blade pierces his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.48,1:30:23.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会抛弃你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not abandon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.44,1:30:29.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.16,1:30:45.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 贝克特? - 是的 他们都签字了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beckett? - Yes, they're signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.38,1:30:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,东印度公司的贝克特勋爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Cutler Beckett of the East lndia Trading Company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.51,1:30:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔在为贝克特勋爵效劳! 他可一个字也没提过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will was working for Beckett and never said a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.64,1:30:57.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克特想要你的罗盘 目的只有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beckett wants the compass. Only one reason for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.52,1:31:00.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.15,1:31:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他想得到亡灵箱 - 没错 他的确提到过什么宝箱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He wants the chest. - Yes, he did say something about a chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.99,1:31:07.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果东印度公司控制了亡灵箱 就等于控制了整个大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the company controls the chest, they controls the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.70,1:31:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大海将面临灾难 亲爱的 - 还有厄运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A truly discomfiting notion, love. - And bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.54,1:31:15.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天下每个海盗的厄运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad for every mother's son what calls himself a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.29,1:31:18.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要加快速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's a bit more speed to be coaxed from these sails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.63,1:31:20.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,升船头帆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace the foreyard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.84,1:31:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我是怎么得到这东西的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might I enquire as to how you came by these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.13,1:31:26.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说服力 - 是友好的那种么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Persuasion. - Friendly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.13,1:31:27.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decidedly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.84,1:31:33.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔为了它煞费苦心 你却轻而易举就得到了 赦免令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will strikes a deal, yet you were the one with the prize, full pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.52,1:31:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,“作为大英帝国授权的私掠船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Commission as a privateer on behalf of England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.94,1:31:38.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,替东印度公司服务”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the East lndia Trading Company."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.73,1:31:41.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这点东西就能收买我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if I could be bought for such a low price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.11,1:31:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你把赦免令还给我 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack, the letters, give them back. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.69,1:31:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得先说服我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Persuade me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.11,1:31:49.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道威尔教过我如何用剑吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know Will taught me how to handle a sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.28,1:31:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 要先说服我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said, persuade me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.27,1:32:12.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a curious thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.81,1:32:19.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经愿意舍弃一切 只想换来你对我动情一笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a time I would have wanted you to look like that while thinking about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.56,1:32:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不懂你的意思 - 我知道你懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know what you mean. - I think you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.02,1:32:24.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别瞎猜 我只是信任他而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be absurd. I trust him, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.53,1:32:31.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那未婚夫怎么会无缘无故{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you never wondered how your latest fiance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.91,1:32:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,沦落到"飞行的荷兰人"上呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ended up on the Flying Dutchman in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.44,1:33:03.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,公海上突然出现一艘救生艇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange to come upon a longboat so far out in open water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.81,1:33:07.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好开全速 越快越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just put as many leagues behind us as you can. As fast as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.32,1:33:10.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要逃避什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are we running from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.24,1:33:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这套女装 哪儿来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That dress. Where did you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.11,1:33:19.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船上找到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was found aboard the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.90,1:33:24.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船员们认为这是幽灵带来的 某种坏运气的征兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew thought it was a spirit bringing some omen of ill-fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.49,1:33:27.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 胡说八道 - 是啊 一派胡言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's foolish. - Yes. Exceedingly foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.00,1:33:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它可给我们带来了好运 幽灵告诉我们"去托图加岛"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brought good fortune. The spirit told us, "Pull in at Tortuga",{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.09,1:33:36.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在那里挣了一大笔钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we made a nice bit of profit there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.17,1:33:39.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像魔术一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off the books, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.38,1:33:43.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你们船员中有人在托图加岛离船了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine some of your crew may have jumped ship there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.26,1:33:46.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么这么问? - 船长!一艘船向我们驶来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you ask? - Captain! A ship's been spotted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.22,1:33:49.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 旗帜什么颜色? - 没有旗帜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Colours? - She isn't flying any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.14,1:33:51.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是海盗 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pirates. - Or worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.61,1:34:06.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我挣大眼睛好好瞧着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.33,1:34:16.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢声笑语顿然不再{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let no joyful voice be heard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.46,1:34:21.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仰天绝望尝尽悲哀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let no man look up at the sky with hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.92,1:34:29.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天让他们见识什么叫厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let this day be cursed by we who ready to wake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.13,1:34:33.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,召唤挪威海怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the kraken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.72,1:34:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.28,1:34:54.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这船人都害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've doomed us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.28,1:34:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是"飞行的荷兰人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Flying Dutchman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.04,1:35:05.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的这是怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother Carey's chickens! What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.54,1:35:08.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是触礁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have hit a reef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.72,1:35:18.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,松舵!左满舵然后右满舵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free the rudder! Hard to port then hard to starboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.85,1:35:22.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 松舵! - 左满舵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Free the rudder! - Hard to port!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.61,1:35:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 挪威海怪! - 挪威海怪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kraken! - Kraken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.57,1:35:49.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里!拿去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it is! Take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.62,1:35:51.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.52,1:38:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没看到那小子 一定是被大海吞噬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy's not here. He must have been claimed by the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.15,1:38:10.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.33,1:38:17.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你点时间哀悼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need time alone with your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.66,1:38:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 布羚! - 幸存者怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brig! - What of the survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.71,1:38:29.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无一幸存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.28,1:38:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亡灵箱已经不再安全了 向克鲁斯岛出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chest is no longer safe. Chart a course to lsla Cruces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.23,1:38:55.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要先到达 不然有你们受的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me there first, or there'll be the devil to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.03,1:38:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"先到达"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"First"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.94,1:39:01.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁把那小贼安排在我船上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent that thieving charlatan onto my ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.24,1:39:03.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁告诉他有关钥匙的事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who told him of the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.33,1:39:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.85,1:39:33.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对女人的直觉告诉我你心情烦躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My intuitive sense of the female creature informs me that you are troubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.73,1:39:37.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在想我现在本该结婚了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought I'd be married by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.23,1:39:39.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为结婚做了那么多的准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so ready to be married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.12,1:39:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.79,1:39:56.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莉齐 我是船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lizzie, I am captain of a ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.29,1:40:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一名船长 我必须完成"结啊婚"的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and being captain of a ship, I could in fact perform a "marr-i-age" right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.88,1:40:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这甲板上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on this deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.34,1:40:09.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立即完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.93,1:40:15.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.30,1:40:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.93,1:40:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是那么的相似 你和我 我和你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are very much alike, you and l. I and you. Us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.77,1:40:25.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了荣誉感 行为准则和道德体系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for a sense of honour and decency and a moral centre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.60,1:40:28.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有个人卫生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And personal hygiene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.48,1:40:31.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都是小事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.86,1:40:34.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你早晚会跟我当海盗的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will come over to my side. I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.49,1:40:39.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好像很有把握 - 一个词 亲爱的 好奇心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You seem very certain. - One word, love. Curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.87,1:40:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你渴望自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You long for freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.58,1:40:44.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,渴望能做自己想做的事情 这是你的个性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You long to do what you want to do because you want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.75,1:40:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲动而且执着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To act on selfish impulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.92,1:40:50.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想去亲身体验一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to see what it's like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.76,1:40:55.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早晚有一天 你将无法抗拒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, you won't be able to resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.76,1:40:58.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你的罗盘失灵了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why doesn't your compass work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.97,1:41:03.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的罗盘工作得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My compass works fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.48,1:41:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you and I are alike,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.35,1:41:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都有善良的一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there will come a moment when you have a chance to show it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.69,1:41:11.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它会找时机表现出来的 - 我很珍惜这种时机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To do the right thing. - I love those moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.49,1:41:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每当这种时机降临时 我总会挥手相送{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to wave at them as they pass by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.86,1:41:20.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将有机会做勇敢正义之事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have the chance to do something... something courageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.54,1:41:23.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到那时 你会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you do, you'll discover something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.79,1:41:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你原来是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.46,1:41:28.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有证据显示 事实恰恰相反{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All evidence to the contrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.04,1:41:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你有信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have faith in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.17,1:41:35.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想知道为什么吗? - 那就说吧 小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Want to know why? - Do tell, dearie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.88,1:41:39.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好奇心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.97,1:41:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你渴望得到一个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.02,1:41:46.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,受人钦佩 得到嘉奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance to be admired and gain the rewards that follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.23,1:41:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将无法抗拒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be able to resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.77,1:41:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会想去亲身体验一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to want to know what it tastes like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.53,1:42:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的确想亲身体验一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do want to knowwhat it tastes like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.62,1:42:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 身为一个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, seeing as you're a good man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.50,1:42:08.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不会趁人之危{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you'd never put me in a position that would compromise my honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.22,1:42:19.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你自豪 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.43,1:42:22.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陆地!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land, ho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.44,1:42:29.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要我那罐土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my jar of dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.73,1:42:33.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你划的太快了 - 是你划的太慢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're pulling too fast. - You're pulling too slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.73,1:42:38.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们都不想挪威海怪追上我们 - 我是在为紧急关头攒把力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't want the kraken to catch us. - I'm saving me strength for when it comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.96,1:42:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才不叫"挪威海兽"呢 别人都它叫"挪威海贼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't think it's "kracken" anyways. I always heard it said "krayken".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.46,1:42:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,A发长音?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a long a?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.17,1:42:49.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 "挪威海王"是北欧那边的发音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no... "Krocken" is how it's pronounced in Scandinavian,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.13,1:42:50.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"挪威海兽"更接近一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and "kracken" is closer to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.97,1:42:54.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不在北欧 不是吗? "挪威海贼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't Scandinavians, are we? "Krayken."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.51,1:42:57.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它不过是个神话中的动物 我想怎样称乎就怎样称乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mythological creature. I can calls it what I wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.10,1:43:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把船看好 注意潮水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard the boat. Mind the tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.44,1:43:05.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我那罐土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch my dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.64,1:43:46.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它坏了 根本就不能指向你想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't work. And it certainly doesn't show you what you want most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.03,1:43:54.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然能 你就坐在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it does. You're sitting on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.24,1:43:56.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么? - 起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beg pardon? - Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.67,1:44:07.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- "把船看好!""注意潮水!" - 我要参加马戏团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Guard the boat!" "Mind the tide!" - I could join the circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.55,1:44:09.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要我给你擦鞋啊 先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I shine your shoes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.60,1:44:18.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经到了 我已经近十年不能上岸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here. And I cannot step foot on land again for near of a decade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.40,1:44:20.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信我们能做好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll trust us to act in your stead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.49,1:44:23.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们相信如果失败会有什么后果!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll trust you to know what awaits you should you fail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.45,1:44:28.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 下潜 马上! - 下潜!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Down, then! - Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.15,1:45:40.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.19,1:45:43.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真说了句实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You actually were telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.36,1:45:46.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过很多实话 不知为什么当人们发现时总是会惊讶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do that quite a lot, yet people are always surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.00,1:45:49.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这其中是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With good reason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.96,1:45:52.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.50,1:45:56.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事!谢天谢地 我是来找你的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all right! Thank God! I came to find you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.35,1:46:04.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么到这来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.56,1:46:08.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我捉住一对海龟 绑在双脚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sea turtles, mate. A pair of them, strapped to my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.60,1:46:10.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,游过来不容易 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so easy, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.56,1:46:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过我还得好好谢谢你 杰克 - 真的么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I do owe you thanks, Jack. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.28,1:46:17.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是你先骗我上了戴维·琼斯的船 让我去还你的债{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you tricked me onto that ship to square your debt with Jones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.53,1:46:19.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.16,1:46:23.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才能和我父亲重聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I was reunited with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.41,1:46:25.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不必客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're welcome, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.12,1:46:29.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对我说的每件事每个字都是谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you said to me, every word was a lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.04,1:46:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.63,1:46:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恶习难改 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time and tide, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.09,1:46:36.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哎! 你想干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.42,1:46:39.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to kill Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.80,1:46:43.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行 威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't let you do that, William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.18,1:46:49.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果琼斯死了 谁还能驾驭他那只怪兽?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cos if Jones is dead, who's to call his terrible beastie off the hunt, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.28,1:46:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 如果你不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.28,1:47:01.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把钥匙给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.99,1:47:06.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要兑现我的诺言 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep the promises I make, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.79,1:47:10.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要还父亲的自由 我希望你能目睹一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to free my father. I hope you're here to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.21,1:47:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不能让你那么做 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let you do that either. So sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.92,1:47:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你早晚会站在我这一边的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd warm up to me eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.39,1:47:22.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克特勋爵渴望得到这箱子里的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Beckett desires the content of that chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.44,1:47:25.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦给他带回去 我将重新拥有一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I deliver it, I get my life back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.15,1:47:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阴险的野心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dark side of ambition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.78,1:47:32.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为是赎罪的曙光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer to see it as the promise of redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.83,1:47:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.09,1:47:46.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.59,1:47:50.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看好箱子! - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guard the chest! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.80,1:47:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太野蛮了! 没门儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is barbaric! This is no way for grown men to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.51,1:48:01.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧!我们都拔出剑来互相攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine! Let's just haul out our swords and start banging away at each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.39,1:48:04.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样能解决所有的事情! 我受够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will solve everything! I've had it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.10,1:48:09.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了你们这些软脚虾 烂酒鬼 臭海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had it with wobbly-legged, rum-soaked pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.77,1:48:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这到底是怎么回事儿啊? - 他们都想独吞箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd this go all screwy? - Well, each wants the chest for hisself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.02,1:48:20.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿想拿回去立功赎罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Norrington, I think, is trying to regain a bit of honour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.28,1:48:22.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克想还给琼斯 挽回面子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}old Jack's looking to trade it, save his own skin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.86,1:48:27.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳想兑现诺言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then Turner, there, I think he's trying to settle some unresolved business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.12,1:48:30.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救他变成水鬼的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'twixt him and his twice-cursed pirate father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.83,1:48:32.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 悲哀 - 真是疯子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sad. - This is madness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.87,1:48:36.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那箱子一定价值不菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That chest must be worth more than a shiny penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.75,1:48:38.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是祸根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrible temptation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.75,1:48:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们还有点良知 就应该为他们除去这罪魁祸首{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we was any kind of decent, we'd remove temptation from their path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.43,1:48:52.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.62,1:49:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太热了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.26,1:49:22.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.49,1:49:36.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了 特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By your leave, Mr Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.92,1:50:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了 诺灵顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By your leave, Mr Norrington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.09,1:51:22.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我得先杀了这个毁了我一生幸福的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do excuse me while I kill the man who ruined my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.18,1:51:26.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 请便 - 让我们先核实这说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be my guest. - Let us examine that claim for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.64,1:51:32.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁 在你把臭名昭著的海盗 放心地关到监牢的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was it, that at the very moment you had a notorious pirate safely behind bars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.19,1:51:38.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乘机放走了海盗 把你的心上人据为己有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saw fit to free said pirate and take your dearly beloved all to hisself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.11,1:51:42.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 到底是谁的错?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whose fault is it, really,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.78,1:51:47.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你沦落为酗酒的低等水手 听命于海盗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you've ended up a rum-pot deckhand what takes orders from pirates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.25,1:51:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.50,1:51:55.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 特纳先生 他是对的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, Mr Turner, he's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.26,1:51:59.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是支持你的 伙计!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still rooting for you, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.32,1:53:00.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it! We got it! We got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.50,1:53:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊 小妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.40,1:53:46.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊!冲啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.16,1:54:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 剑! - 剑!剑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sword! - Sword! Sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.08,1:54:36.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,剑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.33,1:55:19.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我的声音 跟着我的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow my voice. Follow my voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.04,1:55:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往左...不 转回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the left... no, turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.38,1:55:24.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往右点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.55,1:55:27.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 那是颗树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.13,1:55:28.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.17,1:56:20.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这罐土!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jar of dirt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.65,1:57:22.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.81,1:57:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.78,1:58:10.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 特纳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Turner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.97,1:58:31.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他躺那儿! 除非你要用他砸人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him lie! Unless you plan on using him to hit something with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.93,1:58:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们逃不掉了 - 带着箱子就无法脱身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not getting out of this. - Not with the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.69,1:58:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.73,1:58:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你疯了! - 不要等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're mad! - Don't wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.86,1:58:49.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说我们该尊重他的临终愿望 - 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I say we respect his final wish. - Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.00,1:59:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的勇敢算是白搭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bravery is wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.88,1:59:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会从你冰冷尸体的手中拿过亡灵箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall pry the chest away from your cold, dead hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.10,1:59:12.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.65,1:59:26.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,臭海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.55,1:59:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 亡灵箱怎么样了? - 诺灵顿带着它引开了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to the chest? - Norrington took it to draw them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.47,1:59:51.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你拉得太用力! - 你用力得不够!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're pulling too hard! - You ain't pulling hard enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.14,1:59:55.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 司令官哪里去了? - 落在后面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the commodore? - Fell behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.27,1:59:57.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我为他祈祷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My prayers be with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.52,1:59:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是要节哀顺变!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best not wallow in our grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.60,2:00:04.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你回来了 毫发无伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bright side is you're back, and made it off free and clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.83,2:00:22.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天父在上 保佑我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord on high, deliver us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.42,2:00:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来处理这事 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll handle this, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.51,2:00:31.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死鱼脸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi, fishface!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.64,2:00:35.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丢东西了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose something? Eh? Scungilli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.48,2:00:42.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.69,2:00:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来谈判的吧? 你个欠揍的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to negotiate, eh, have you, you slimy git?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.82,2:00:48.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我手上是啥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.36,2:00:51.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一罐土 我有一罐土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a jar of dirt. I got a jar of dirt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.53,2:00:53.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜里面是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess what's inside it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.37,2:00:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.96,2:01:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 右满舵 - 右满舵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hard to starboard. - Hard to starboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.79,2:01:09.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,升船头帆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace up the foreyard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.08,2:01:15.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,右满舵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to starboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.21,2:01:20.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他心爱的珍珠号送回地狱去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send his beloved Pearl back to the depths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.19,2:01:36.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,敌火来袭!敌火来袭!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on us! She's on us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.65,2:01:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让他们尝尝三联炮 - 是 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let them taste the triple guns. - Aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.60,2:02:09.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绑牢固了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.39,2:02:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 亲爱的! 让我们看看你的实力!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, me darling! Show us what you've got!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.02,2:02:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.82,2:02:24.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它被甩掉了 - 对 我们把它甩掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's falling behind! - Aye. We've got her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.32,2:02:28.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们的船快? - 逆风的话 他们快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're the faster? - Against the wind, the Dutchman beats us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.12,2:02:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过现在顺风... - 我们占优势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But with the wind... - We rob her advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.66,2:02:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.54,2:02:36.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们超出射程了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of range!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.17,2:02:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停止追击 降下帆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break off pursuit, run her light and douse canvas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.88,2:02:43.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们放弃了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're giving up, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.35,2:02:55.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们放弃了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're giving up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.74,2:03:03.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲在那条船上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father is on that ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.95,2:03:06.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能赢 我们应该回头战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can take her. We should turn and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.53,2:03:13.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能谈判时干吗要战斗? 只需要有足够的优势就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why fight when you can negotiate? All one needs is the proper leverage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.59,2:03:26.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿了? "砰-砰"去哪儿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? Where is the thump-thump?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.76,2:03:30.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们肯定撞到礁石了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have hit a reef!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.81,2:03:36.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 那不是礁石! 离开船舷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's not a reef! Get away from the rail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.94,2:03:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是什么东西? - 是挪威海怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - The kraken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.36,2:03:42.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备战斗! - 拿好枪!保护桅杆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To arms! - Load guns! Defend the mast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.69,2:03:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它会从底下攻击 上炮位 等我信号!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll attack the starboard. Run out the cannons and hold for my signal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.73,2:04:23.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松点 伙计们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.57,2:04:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.11,2:04:30.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稳住!稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady! Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.28,2:04:35.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威尔! - 稳住!稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will! - Hold. Hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.83,2:04:38.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等得够久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've held fire long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.04,2:04:42.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威尔! - 开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will! - Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.52,2:05:06.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它会回来的 我们得离船 - 没有小艇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt'll be back. We have to get off the ship. - There's no boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.28,2:05:18.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起壁炉! 把所有火药放进货舱的网兜!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull the grates. Get all the gunpowder onto the net in the cargo hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.21,2:05:25.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不管怎样 不要射失 - 等你准备好我就开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever you do, don't miss. - As soon as you're clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.85,2:05:43.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们火药不足 只有六桶了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are short-stocked on gunpowder! Six barrels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.98,2:05:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.19,2:05:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 火药只有半打了! - 那就装郎姆酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's only six kegs of powder! - Then load the rum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.66,2:06:02.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧!郎姆酒也上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, the rum too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.69,2:06:32.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.37,2:06:38.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.79,2:06:45.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不太妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.72,2:06:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉上去! - 拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Haul away! - Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.51,2:07:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 使劲拉上去! - 用尽全力!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heave like you're being paid for it! - Put your backs into it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.93,2:07:47.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我抓住你了!我抓住你了! - 不要抛弃我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got you! I got you! - Don't let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.27,2:07:49.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不会抛弃你的! - 向我开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't let you go! - Shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.24,2:07:58.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了? - 往上走!往上走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear? - Higher! Higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.13,2:08:17.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边!快来啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.93,2:08:20.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来抓我 我在这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get me. I'm over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.64,2:08:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.67,2:08:50.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪 伊丽莎白 开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot! Elizabeth, shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.21,2:10:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们干掉它了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we kill it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.22,2:10:23.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们只是激怒了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We just made it angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.22,2:10:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没解脱 船长 下命令!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not out of this yet. Captain, orders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.10,2:10:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弃船 上小艇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship. Into the longboat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.06,2:10:36.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克!这是珍珠号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack. The Pearl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.19,2:10:40.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是条船 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's only a ship, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.65,2:10:43.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是对的 我们必需登陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right. We have to head for land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.28,2:10:46.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有很宽的水面 - 还很宽啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a lot of open water. - It's a lot ofwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.45,2:10:51.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必需试试 如果它要毁掉珍珠号 我们还能逃脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to try. We can get away as it takes down the Pearl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.00,2:10:54.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弃船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.92,2:10:57.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放弃船 或者放弃希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship or abandon hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.06,2:11:16.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.31,2:11:21.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有脱身呢 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not free yet, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.14,2:11:23.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.86,2:11:28.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always knew you were a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.54,2:11:44.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备跳吧 没时间可以浪费了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to cast off. There's no time to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.42,2:11:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快 威尔 往下走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Will. Step to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.98,2:12:08.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是在追杀你 不是这船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's after you, not the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.52,2:12:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.53,2:12:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这个办法 你明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the only way, don't you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.62,2:12:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得内疚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.33,2:12:27.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.73,2:12:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.53,2:12:56.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他决定留下 给我们个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He elected to stay behind to give us a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.16,2:13:06.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出发!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.76,2:13:22.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 混蛋 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugger. Bugger, bugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.46,2:13:53.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.84,2:14:00.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just got it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.67,2:14:32.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不算太糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.43,2:14:45.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 小怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, beastie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.10,2:15:38.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·斯派洛 我们的帐一笔勾销了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow, our debt is settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.65,2:15:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长与船同沉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The captain goes down with his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.99,2:15:45.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算杰克·斯派洛也不能战胜魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out not even Jack Sparrow can best the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.29,2:15:53.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开亡灵箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.00,2:15:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开亡灵箱 我要亲眼看到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the chest. I need to see it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.13,2:16:19.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 杰克·斯派洛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, Jack Sparrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.94,2:16:27.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最后一条船回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last of our ships is returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.77,2:16:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亡灵箱有何消息?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any news on the chest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.28,2:16:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 不过在海上救起一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. But one of the ships did pick up a man adrift at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.99,2:16:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他身上有这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.12,2:16:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我冒昧地填上了我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took the liberty of filling in my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.84,2:16:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要的话 就得有东西来交换{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you intend to claim these, then you must have something to trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.01,2:17:02.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到罗盘了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the compass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.73,2:17:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比那更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.73,2:17:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·琼斯的心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heart of Davy Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.71,2:18:12.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酒可御寒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against the cold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.25,2:18:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也能解忧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the sorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.85,2:18:27.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.52,2:18:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你以为只要有了黑珍珠号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're thinking that with the Pearl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.06,2:18:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以去擒住恶魔 救回你父亲的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could have captured the devil and set free your father's soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.53,2:18:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经无关紧要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.36,2:18:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,珍珠号完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pearl is gone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.03,2:18:42.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连同它的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with its captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.08,2:18:45.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.37,2:18:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这世界已经灰暗了一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And already the world seems a bit less bright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.37,2:18:52.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直都在欺骗我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fooled us all right till the end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.59,2:18:56.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但最后他的良心还是胜出了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I guess that honest streak finally won out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.22,2:19:00.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为杰克·斯派洛干杯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.05,2:19:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再也不会有第二个杰克船长了 - 他是位绅士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never another like Captain Jack. - He was a gentleman of fortune, he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.64,2:19:08.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.41,2:19:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什么可以救他回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there was anything could be done to bring him back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.88,2:19:38.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伊丽莎白 - 你会去做吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Elizabeth. - Would you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.84,2:19:42.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会去做么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.64,2:19:49.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都愿做么 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would any of you be willing to do, hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.73,2:19:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会航行到天涯海角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you sail to the ends of the Earth and beyond{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.73,2:19:59.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找回杰克和无价的珍珠号?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to fetch back witty Jack and him precious Pearl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.95,2:20:07.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.29,2:20:09.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.25,2:20:11.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.79,2:20:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.84,2:20:18.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.17,2:20:22.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.51,2:20:24.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.55,2:20:32.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果想去奇异而又充满牛鬼蛇神的天涯海角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you go and brave the weird and haunted shores at world's end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.69,2:20:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就需要一位称职的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you will need a captain who knows those waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.88,2:20:59.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说 我的船怎么样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me, what's become of my ship?{\r}
